וֺ עָלָיו ׳י, Job 36:30 ; spread out writing, לִפְנֵי Pers. 2Kin 19:14 = Isa 37:14 ; Ezek 2:10 ; sail Isa 33:23 ; fishingnet, מִכְמֶרֶת 19:8 ( עַל location); net ( רֶשֶׁת ) as snare, figurative Hosea 5:1 ( עַל location), Psa 140:6 , לְרַגְלַי Lam 1:13 , with עַל person Hosea 7:12 (of ׳י , Ezek 12:13 = 17:20 ; 19:8 ; 32:3 , עַלעְֲָֿמָיו Prov 29:5 ; ׳פ כַּמַּיִם in prayer, + אַל Exod 9:29 , 33 (J), 1Kin 8:38 2Chr 6:29 ; Ezra 9:5 ; Job 11:13 , +, ל Psa 44:21 , +, הַשָּׁמַיִם 1Kin 8:22 2Chr 6:13 ( הַשָּׁמָ֑יְמָה ), 1Kin 8:54 , no complem. 2Chr 6:12 ; of almsgiving, לֶעָנִי מָּֽרְשָׂה כַּמָּהּ Prov 31:20 ; ׳פ יַד , with עַל of thing, Lam 1:10 of enemy's greed (si vera lectio, see Bu); spread out = display אִוֶּלֶת יִפְרשֹׁ וּכְסִיל Prov 13:16 . 2 spread covering over 2Sam 17:19 ( מָסָךְ + עַלמְּֿנֵי of thing), הַמַּכְבֵּר over ( עַל ) face of another 2Kin 8:15 , כָּנָף skirt , עַל person Ruth 3:9 ; Ezek 16:8 (figurative of ׳י ); בֶּגֶּד with עַל of thing Num 4:7-8 , : 4:11 , 13 with מִלְמָ֑עְלָה v6; כְּסוּי with עַל of thing 4:14 ; אֶתהָֿאֹהֶל , with עַלהַֿמִּשְׁכָּן Exod 40:19 ; עַלהֶֿהָרִים מָּרֻשׂ שַׁחַר Joel 2:2 ; of לְמָסָךְ ׳פ עָנָן ׳י Psa 105:39 . &#8212; Micah 3:3 ; Lam 4:4 see מָּרַס . Niph`al Imperfect 3masculine plural יִכָר֑שׂוּ Ezek 17:21 they shall be scattered לְכָלרֿוּחַ ; 34:12 read probably Participle נִפְרָשׂוֺת צאֹן for שׁוֺת -, Hä Krae; on emendation of context see especially Toy Krae). Pi`el Perfect 3masculine singular consecutive וּפֵרַשׂ Isa 25:11 etc. Imperfect 3masculine singular יְפָרֵשׂ v11, 3feminine singular תְּפָרֵשׂ Jer 4:31 ; Infinitive cstr מָּרֵשׂ Psa 68:15 , suffix מָּרִשְׂכֶם Isa 1:15 ; &#8212; 1 spread out: a. with accusative כַּפַיִם in prayer Isa 1:15 ; Jer 4:31 so with יָדַיִם Psa 143:6 ( ׳אֶליֿ ), and of ׳י entreating people Isa 65:2 ( אֶל ); ׳פ בְּיָדֶיהָ צִיֹון Lam 1:17 . b. spread out hands as in swimming Isa 25:11 , and ( יָדַיִם omitted) 25:11 . 2 = scatter , (?) subject ׳י , with accusative of person Zech 2:10 ( ᵐ5 We Now מִ֖ קִבַּצְתִּי